- 5 Medium risk items should have documented management plans and regular monitoring

**Important**: Removal decisions should only be made by a licensed asbestos assessor after on-site inspection. High risk items don't always require removal - encapsulation or other management strategies may be appropriate depending on the specific situation.

I recommend engaging a licensed asbestos professional to review the High risk items and provide formal recommendations.
